---
import CalculatorLayout from '../../layouts/CalculatorLayout.astro';
---

<CalculatorLayout
  title="Crypto Profit & Tax Calculator – Bitcoin P&L with Indian Tax (30% + 1% TDS)"
  description="Calculate cryptocurrency profit/loss, Indian 30% crypto tax with 1% TDS, average buy price for multiple purchases, and target price for desired profit. Supports all coins."
  category="Finance"
  calculatorName="Crypto Profit & Tax Calculator"
  slug="crypto-calculator"
  keywords={[
    'crypto profit calculator',
    'crypto tax calculator india',
    'cryptocurrency profit loss calculator',
    'bitcoin profit calculator',
    'crypto tax india 30 percent',
    'crypto tds calculator',
    'average crypto buy price calculator',
    'crypto target price calculator',
    'crypto calculator india'
  ]}
>
  <div class="space-y-6">

    <!-- TABS -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-white p-2.5 shadow-2xs dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 overflow-x-auto pb-1 text-xs font-semibold scrollbar-thin">
        <button type="button" class="btn-crypto-tab active shrink-0 rounded-lg bg-orange-500 px-3.5 py-1.5 font-bold text-white shadow-xs cursor-pointer" data-tab="pnl">Profit / Loss Calculator</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn-crypto-tab shrink-0 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3.5 py-1.5 font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 cursor-pointer" data-tab="avg">Avg. Entry Price 📊</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn-crypto-tab shrink-0 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3.5 py-1.5 font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 cursor-pointer" data-tab="target">Target Price Calculator 🎯</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn-crypto-tab shrink-0 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3.5 py-1.5 font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 cursor-pointer" data-tab="tax">Indian Tax 30% + TDS 🇮🇳</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- PRESETS -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-white p-3.5 shadow-2xs dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 text-xs">
        <span class="font-bold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mr-1">⚡ Popular Coins:</span>
        <button type="button" class="btn-crypto-preset rounded-lg border border-orange-300 bg-orange-50 px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold text-orange-700 hover:bg-orange-100 dark:border-orange-700 dark:bg-orange-950/30 dark:text-orange-300 cursor-pointer" data-coin="BTC" data-buy="45000" data-sell="65000" data-qty="0.1">₿ BTC: ₹45K buy, ₹65K sell, 0.1 coin</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn-crypto-preset rounded-lg border border-blue-300 bg-blue-50 px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold text-blue-700 hover:bg-blue-100 dark:border-blue-700 dark:bg-blue-950/30 dark:text-blue-300 cursor-pointer" data-coin="ETH" data-buy="2500" data-sell="4000" data-qty="1">Ξ ETH: ₹2.5K buy, ₹4K sell, 1 coin</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn-crypto-preset rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-orange-500 hover:text-orange-600 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 cursor-pointer" data-coin="BNB" data-buy="350" data-sell="600" data-qty="5">BNB: ₹350 buy, ₹600 sell, 5 coins</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MAIN PANEL -->
    <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-linear-to-br from-white via-orange-50/20 to-yellow-50/20 p-5 shadow-xl shadow-slate-900/5 dark:border-slate-800 dark:from-slate-950 dark:via-slate-950 dark:to-orange-950/10 sm:p-7">

      <!-- P&L PANEL -->
      <div id="panel-pnl" class="crypto-panel space-y-5">
        <div class="border-b border-slate-200/80 pb-3 dark:border-slate-800">
          <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2"><span>₿</span> Crypto Profit & Loss Calculator</h2>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Calculate your crypto profit or loss, ROI%, and Indian tax liability (30% tax + 1% TDS on sell value).</p>
        </div>
        <form id="form-crypto-pnl" class="space-y-4" novalidate onsubmit="return false;">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <div><label for="c-coin" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Coin Name (Optional)</label><input type="text" id="c-coin" value="Bitcoin (BTC)" class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-2.5 text-sm font-bold dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white" placeholder="e.g., Bitcoin, ETH, DOGE" /></div>
            <div><label for="c-qty" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Quantity of Coins</label><input type="number" id="c-qty" value="0.1" step="any" min="0" class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-2.5 text-sm font-bold dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white" /></div>
            <div><label for="c-buy" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Buy Price per Coin (₹ or $)</label><input type="number" id="c-buy" value="45000" step="any" class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-2.5 text-sm font-bold dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white" /></div>
            <div><label for="c-sell" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Sell Price per Coin (₹ or $)</label><input type="number" id="c-sell" value="65000" step="any" class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-2.5 text-sm font-bold dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white" /></div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-orange-200 bg-orange-50 p-3 dark:border-orange-700 dark:bg-orange-950/30">
            <input type="checkbox" id="indian-tax" class="h-4 w-4 rounded border-slate-300 text-orange-600 cursor-pointer" checked />
            <label for="indian-tax" class="text-xs font-semibold text-orange-800 dark:text-orange-300 cursor-pointer">🇮🇳 Calculate as per Indian Tax Rules (30% flat tax on profit + 1% TDS on sell value)</label>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 pt-2">
            <button type="submit" id="btn-pnl-calc" class="flex-1 rounded-xl bg-orange-500 hover:bg-orange-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-extrabold text-white shadow-lg shadow-orange-500/25 transition active:scale-[0.98] cursor-pointer">Calculate P&L →</button>
            <button type="button" id="btn-pnl-clear" class="rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 transition cursor-pointer">Clear (✕)</button>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>

      <!-- AVERAGE ENTRY PANEL -->
      <div id="panel-avg" class="crypto-panel hidden space-y-5">
        <div class="border-b border-slate-200/80 pb-3 dark:border-slate-800">
          <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2"><span>📊</span> Average Entry Price Calculator (DCA / Dip Buying)</h2>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Bought the same coin multiple times at different prices? Calculate your average buy price (DCA strategy).</p>
        </div>
        <form id="form-avg" class="space-y-4" novalidate onsubmit="return false;">
          <div id="avg-entries" class="space-y-3">
            <div class="avg-entry grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
              <div><label class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 block">Buy Price (Entry 1)</label><input type="number" class="avg-price mt-1 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-2.5 text-sm font-bold dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white" value="40000" step="any" /></div>
              <div><label class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 block">Quantity (Entry 1)</label><input type="number" class="avg-qty mt-1 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-2.5 text-sm font-bold dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white" value="0.1" step="any" /></div>
            </div>
            <div class="avg-entry grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
              <div><label class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 block">Buy Price (Entry 2)</label><input type="number" class="avg-price mt-1 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-2.5 text-sm font-bold dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white" value="35000" step="any" /></div>
              <div><label class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 block">Quantity (Entry 2)</label><input type="number" class="avg-qty mt-1 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-2.5 text-sm font-bold dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white" value="0.15" step="any" /></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <button type="button" id="btn-add-entry" class="w-full rounded-xl border-2 border-dashed border-slate-300 bg-white px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-bold text-slate-600 hover:border-orange-400 hover:text-orange-600 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-300 transition cursor-pointer">+ Add Another Buy Entry</button>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <button type="submit" id="btn-avg-calc" class="flex-1 rounded-xl bg-orange-500 hover:bg-orange-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-extrabold text-white shadow-lg shadow-orange-500/25 transition active:scale-[0.98] cursor-pointer">Calculate Average Price →</button>
            <button type="button" id="btn-avg-clear" class="rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 transition cursor-pointer">Clear (✕)</button>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>

      <!-- TARGET PRICE PANEL -->
      <div id="panel-target" class="crypto-panel hidden space-y-5">
        <div class="border-b border-slate-200/80 pb-3 dark:border-slate-800">
          <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2"><span>🎯</span> Target Price Calculator</h2>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">At what price should you SELL to achieve a specific profit target? Includes Indian 30% tax calculation.</p>
        </div>
        <form id="form-target" class="space-y-4" novalidate onsubmit="return false;">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
            <div><label class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Buy Price per Coin</label><input type="number" id="tgt-buy" value="45000" step="any" class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-2.5 text-sm font-bold dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white" /></div>
            <div><label class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Desired Profit %</label><input type="number" id="tgt-pct" value="50" step="1" class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-2.5 text-sm font-bold dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white" /></div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-orange-200 bg-orange-50/50 p-3 dark:border-orange-800 dark:bg-orange-950/20">
              <input type="checkbox" id="tgt-indian-tax" class="h-4 w-4 rounded cursor-pointer" checked />
              <label for="tgt-indian-tax" class="text-xs font-semibold text-orange-800 dark:text-orange-300 cursor-pointer">Include 30% Indian Tax</label>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <button type="submit" id="btn-target-calc" class="flex-1 rounded-xl bg-orange-500 hover:bg-orange-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-extrabold text-white shadow-lg shadow-orange-500/25 transition active:scale-[0.98] cursor-pointer">Calculate Target Price →</button>
            <button type="button" id="btn-target-clear" class="rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 transition cursor-pointer">Clear (✕)</button>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>

      <!-- INDIAN TAX PANEL -->
      <div id="panel-tax" class="crypto-panel hidden space-y-5">
        <div class="border-b border-slate-200/80 pb-3 dark:border-slate-800">
          <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2"><span>🇮🇳</span> Indian Crypto Tax Calculator (Section 115BBH)</h2>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Since FY 2022-23: 30% flat tax on crypto profits + 1% TDS deducted on sell value. Losses cannot be set off against other income.</p>
        </div>
        <form id="form-tax-crypto" class="space-y-4" novalidate onsubmit="return false;">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <div><label class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Total Buy Value (₹)</label><input type="number" id="itax-buy-val" value="450000" step="1000" class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-2.5 text-sm font-bold dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white" /></div>
            <div><label class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Total Sell Value (₹)</label><input type="number" id="itax-sell-val" value="650000" step="1000" class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-2.5 text-sm font-bold dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white" /></div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <button type="submit" id="btn-tax-crypto-calc" class="flex-1 rounded-xl bg-orange-500 hover:bg-orange-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-extrabold text-white shadow-lg shadow-orange-500/25 transition active:scale-[0.98] cursor-pointer">Calculate Indian Crypto Tax →</button>
            <button type="button" id="btn-tax-crypto-clear" class="rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 transition cursor-pointer">Clear (✕)</button>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>

      <!-- RESULTS -->
      <div id="crypto-results" class="hidden mt-6 space-y-5">
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-orange-200 bg-linear-to-br from-white via-orange-50/40 to-yellow-100/50 p-5 shadow-lg shadow-orange-500/5 dark:border-orange-900/60 dark:from-slate-950 dark:via-slate-900 dark:to-orange-950/30 sm:p-7">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-4 border-b border-orange-200/80 pb-4 dark:border-slate-800">
            <div>
              <span id="crypto-badge" class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-orange-700 dark:text-orange-300">Net Profit (After Tax)</span>
              <div id="crypto-res-profit" class="mt-1 text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">+₹1,40,000</div>
            </div>
            <div class="sm:text-right">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">ROI / Return:</span>
              <div id="crypto-res-roi" class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">+31.1%</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 text-xs">
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-orange-200/60 bg-white/80 p-3 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/70">
              <div class="text-slate-500 font-semibold">Buy Value</div>
              <div id="crypto-res-buy" class="mt-1 text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">₹4,50,000</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-orange-200/60 bg-white/80 p-3 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/70">
              <div class="text-slate-500 font-semibold">Sell Value</div>
              <div id="crypto-res-sell" class="mt-1 text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">₹6,50,000</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-orange-200/60 bg-white/80 p-3 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/70">
              <div class="text-slate-500 font-semibold">Tax (30%)</div>
              <div id="crypto-res-tax" class="mt-1 text-sm font-bold text-red-600 dark:text-red-400">₹60,000</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-orange-200/60 bg-white/80 p-3 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/70">
              <div class="text-slate-500 font-semibold">TDS (1%)</div>
              <div id="crypto-res-tds" class="mt-1 text-sm font-bold text-red-600 dark:text-red-400">₹6,500</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- SEO CONTENT -->
  <Fragment slot="content">
    <section class="crypto-content">
      <h2>Crypto Profit & Tax Calculator – Indian 30% Tax + 1% TDS</h2>
      <p>Our <strong>Crypto Profit & Tax Calculator</strong> is the most comprehensive cryptocurrency tool for Indian investors. It calculates your <strong>profit or loss</strong> on any cryptocurrency trade, applies <strong>Indian Section 115BBH tax rules</strong> (30% flat tax on gains + 1% TDS on sell value), calculates your <strong>average entry price</strong> for DCA purchases, and helps you determine the <strong>target sell price</strong> needed to achieve a specific profit after tax.</p>

      <h2>Indian Crypto Tax Rules (Section 115BBH) – Explained</h2>
      <p>From <strong>April 1, 2022 (FY 2022-23)</strong>, the Indian government introduced specific tax rules for Virtual Digital Assets (VDAs) including cryptocurrencies and NFTs:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>30% Flat Tax:</strong> All crypto profits taxed at flat 30% regardless of income slab — no benefit of lower tax slabs</li>
        <li><strong>1% TDS:</strong> 1% Tax Deducted at Source on every crypto sell transaction exceeding ₹10,000 (₹50,000 for specified persons) per year on exchanges like WazirX, CoinDCX, Binance</li>
        <li><strong>No Loss Set-Off:</strong> Crypto losses cannot be offset against any other income (salary, business, etc.)</li>
        <li><strong>No Cost Inflation Index:</strong> Unlike gold or real estate, no CII benefit is available for crypto</li>
        <li><strong>4% Health & Education Cess:</strong> Applied on top of the 30% tax, making effective rate 31.2%</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How to Calculate Crypto Tax in India</h2>
      <div class="my-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-100/80 p-4 font-mono text-sm dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
        <div>Gross Profit = Sell Value − Buy Value</div>
        <div class="mt-1">Tax (30%) = Gross Profit × 30% (plus 4% cess = 31.2%)</div>
        <div class="mt-1">TDS (1%) = Sell Value × 1%</div>
        <div class="mt-1">Net Profit = Gross Profit − Tax − TDS (already paid)</div>
      </div>

      <h2>Average Entry Price (Dollar-Cost Averaging)</h2>
      <p><strong>Dollar-Cost Averaging (DCA)</strong> is a popular crypto investment strategy where you buy the same coin at regular intervals or on price dips. Calculating your <strong>average entry price</strong> helps you understand your real breakeven point:</p>
      <div class="my-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-100/80 p-4 font-mono text-sm dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
        <div>Avg Buy Price = Total Invested Amount / Total Coins Purchased</div>
        <div class="mt-1">Example: Buy 0.1 BTC at ₹40,000 + 0.15 BTC at ₹35,000 = 0.25 BTC for ₹9,250</div>
        <div class="mt-1">Avg Price = ₹9,250 / 0.25 = ₹37,000 per BTC</div>
      </div>

      <h2>Target Price Calculator – When to Sell?</h2>
      <p>The <strong>Target Price Calculator</strong> tells you at what price you need to sell your coins to achieve a specific profit percentage — after accounting for the 30% Indian tax:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>If you want 50% net profit (after 30% tax), you actually need your gross profit to be 71.4% — because 71.4% × 70% ≈ 50%</li>
        <li>Our calculator automatically does this math for you, giving you the exact sell price target</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Crypto Tax Planning Tips for India</h2>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Keep Detailed Records:</strong> Maintain buy/sell records for every transaction — price, date, quantity, exchange</li>
        <li><strong>Claim TDS Credit:</strong> TDS deducted by exchanges appears in Form 26AS — claim it while filing ITR</li>
        <li><strong>Gifting Crypto:</strong> Receiving crypto as a gift is taxable as income; giving crypto as gift is not taxable for giver but taxable for receiver</li>
        <li><strong>Multiple Exchanges:</strong> Track transactions across WazirX, CoinDCX, Binance, and foreign exchanges separately for accurate ITR filing</li>
        <li><strong>No Long-Term Benefit:</strong> Unlike stocks (LTCG at 10% after 1 year), crypto always attracts 30% tax regardless of holding period</li>
      </ol>
    </section>
  </Fragment>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <Fragment slot="faq">
    <div class="space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm">
      <details class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4 dark:border-slate-800" open>
        <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none"><h3 class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">1. How much tax do I pay on crypto profits in India?<span class="group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span></h3></summary>
        <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">You pay 30% flat tax on crypto profits regardless of your income tax slab, plus 4% cess (effective rate 31.2%). Additionally, 1% TDS is deducted at source on every sell transaction exceeding ₹10,000 per financial year.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4 dark:border-slate-800">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none"><h3 class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">2. What is TDS on crypto in India?<span class="group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span></h3></summary>
        <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">TDS (Tax Deducted at Source) at 1% is deducted on every crypto sell transaction. This is deducted by the exchange (WazirX, CoinDCX, Binance etc.) before crediting your account. You can claim this TDS credit while filing your ITR against your final 30% tax liability.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4 dark:border-slate-800">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none"><h3 class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">3. Can I set off crypto losses against other income?<span class="group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span></h3></summary>
        <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">No. Under Section 115BBH, crypto losses cannot be offset against salary, business income, or any other income. You also cannot carry forward crypto losses to subsequent years (unlike stock market losses which can be carried forward for 8 years).</p>
      </details>
      <details class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4 dark:border-slate-800">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none"><h3 class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">4. What is an average crypto entry price and why does it matter?<span class="group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span></h3></summary>
        <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">When you buy the same coin multiple times at different prices (DCA strategy), your average entry price is your true breakeven point. Formula: Total Amount Invested ÷ Total Coins Bought. You're profitable only when the current price exceeds your average entry price.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4 dark:border-slate-800">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none"><h3 class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">5. Is crypto legal in India in 2025?<span class="group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span></h3></summary>
        <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Cryptocurrency is legal to buy, hold, and sell in India as of 2025. The government has not banned crypto but has imposed strict 30% taxation and reporting requirements. Indian exchanges must collect KYC and deduct TDS. Crypto is not legal tender in India.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4 dark:border-slate-800">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none"><h3 class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">6. How do I report crypto in my ITR?<span class="group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span></h3></summary>
        <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Crypto income must be reported under "Income from Virtual Digital Assets" in Schedule VDA in ITR-2 or ITR-3. Each transaction must be reported separately. TDS credit appears in Form 26AS and can be claimed in ITR. Consult a CA for complex multi-exchange portfolios.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4 dark:border-slate-800">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none"><h3 class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">7. Does the 30% crypto tax apply to losses too?<span class="group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span></h3></summary>
        <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">The 30% tax applies only on profits. If you have a loss (sell price &lt; buy price), you pay zero tax. However, you also cannot use that loss to offset profits from other coins or any other income. Each VDA is treated separately for tax purposes.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </Fragment>
</CalculatorLayout>

